    <!DOCTYPE html>
    <html lang="en">
    <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
    <title><%= product.name %> – Elanora</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
    <style>
        :root {
        --cream: #f5f0ea;
        --warm-white: #faf8f5;
        --gold: #b8892a;
        --gold-light: #d4a843;
        --gold-pale: #f0e0bb;
        --text-dark: #1c1a17;
        --text-mid: #4a4540;
        --text-light: #8a8078;
        --border: #e8dfd4;
        --card-bg: #ffffff;
        }
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body { font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; background: var(--cream); color: var(--text-dark); font-weight: 300; }

        /* ── NAV ── */
        nav {
        background: var(--warm-white);
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 0 48px; height: 64px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
        }
        .logo {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
        text-decoration: none; color: var(--gold);
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 36px; list-style: none; }
        .nav-links a {
        text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--text-mid); transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
        .nav-icons { display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center; }
        .nav-icons button {
        background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;
        color: var(--text-mid); position: relative; padding: 4px; transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .nav-icons button:hover { color: var(--gold); }
        .badge {
        position: absolute; top: -2px; right: -4px;
        background: var(--gold); color: #fff; font-size: 9px;
        width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* ── BREADCRUMB ── */
        .breadcrumb {
        max-width: 1100px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 0 24px;
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
        font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-light);
        }
        .breadcrumb a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-light); transition: color 0.2s; }
        .breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
        .breadcrumb span { color: var(--text-dark); }
        .breadcrumb svg { width: 12px; height: 12px; }

        /* ── PRODUCT SECTION ── */
        .product-section {
        max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto 48px; padding: 0 24px;
        }
        .product-card-wrap {
        background: var(--card-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 28px;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 40px;
        }

        /* LEFT – images */
        .img-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
        .main-img-wrap {
        position: relative; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;
        background: var(--cream); aspect-ratio: 1/1;
        }
        .main-img-wrap img {
        width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;
        transition: transform 0.4s ease;
        }
        .main-img-wrap:hover img { transform: scale(1.04); }
        .wishlist-main {
        position: absolute; top: 12px; right: 12px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); border: none; border-radius: 50%;
        width: 36px; height: 36px; display: flex; align-items: center;
        justify-content: center; cursor: pointer; color: var(--text-light);
        transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .wishlist-main:hover { color: #e05050; }
        .wishlist-main.liked { color: #e05050; }

        .thumbnails { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
        .thumb {
        width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;
        border: 2px solid transparent; cursor: pointer; transition: border-color 0.2s;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .thumb.active { border-color: var(--gold); }
        .thumb img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }

        /* RIGHT – info */
        .info-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }

        .info-top {
        display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .product-name {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-dark); line-height: 1.2;
        }
        .share-btn {
        background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;
        color: var(--text-light); padding: 4px; transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .share-btn:hover { color: var(--gold); }

        .rating-row {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px;
        }
        .stars { display: flex; gap: 2px; }
        .star { color: var(--gold); font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .star.empty { color: var(--border); }
        .rating-text { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-light); }

        .price {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-dark);
        margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .description {
        font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.75;
        margin-bottom: 24px; padding-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .option-label {
        font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-mid); margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .color-options { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .color-opt {
        display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
        cursor: pointer;
        }
        .color-swatch {
        width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%;
        border: 2px solid transparent; transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
        }
        .color-opt.active .color-swatch { border-color: var(--gold); transform: scale(1.1); }
        .color-name { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-light); }

        .qty-label {
        font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-mid); margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .qty-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .qty-btn {
        width: 36px; height: 36px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: var(--cream); cursor: pointer; font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--text-mid); transition: all 0.2s; display: flex;
        align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        }
        .qty-btn:first-child { border-radius: 8px 0 0 8px; }
        .qty-btn:last-child { border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; }
        .qty-btn:hover { background: var(--gold-pale); color: var(--gold); }
        .qty-display {
        width: 48px; height: 36px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-left: none; border-right: none;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 500; background: var(--card-bg);
        }

        .divider-line { height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 4px 0 20px; }

        .cta-row { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .btn-cart {
        flex: 1; background: var(--gold); color: #fff; border: none;
        border-radius: 100px; padding: 14px 20px;
        font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em; cursor: pointer;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;
        transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
        }
        .btn-cart:hover { background: var(--gold-light); transform: scale(1.01); }
        .btn-buy {
        flex: 1; background: transparent; color: var(--gold);
        border: 1.5px solid var(--gold); border-radius: 100px; padding: 14px 20px;
        font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-buy:hover { background: var(--gold-pale); }

        .perks { display: flex; gap: 16px; }
        .perk {
        display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; flex: 1;
        background: var(--cream); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px;
        }
        .perk svg { flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--gold); margin-top: 2px; }
        .perk-text strong { display: block; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-dark); }
        .perk-text span { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-light); }

        /* ── TABS ── */
        .tabs-section { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto 48px; padding: 0 24px; }
        .tab-nav { display: flex; gap: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 28px; }
        .tab-btn {
        padding: 12px 24px; font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-light); background: none;
        border: none; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
        cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        }
        .tab-btn.active { color: var(--gold); border-bottom-color: var(--gold); font-weight: 500; }
        .tab-btn:hover { color: var(--text-dark); }

        .tab-panel { display: none; }
        .tab-panel.active { display: block; }

        .product-details-content h3 {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 14px; color: var(--text-dark);
        }
        .product-details-content p {
        font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 14px;
        }
        .feature-list { list-style: none; margin-top: 8px; }
        .feature-list li {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
        font-size: 0.87rem; color: var(--text-mid);
        padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .feature-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .feature-list li svg { color: var(--gold); flex-shrink: 0; }

        /* reviews */
        .reviews-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
        .review-card {
        background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 20px;
        }
        .reviewer { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .avatar {
        width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--gold-pale); color: var(--gold);
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500;
        }
        .reviewer-name { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-dark); }
        .reviewer-date { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-light); }
        .review-text { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.7; }

        /* ── YOU MAY ALSO LIKE ── */
        .related-section { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto 60px; padding: 0 24px; }
        .section-heading { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .section-heading h2 {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-dark);
        }
        .section-sub {
        text-align: center; font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--text-light); margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .related-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
        .related-card {
        background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden;
        transition: box-shadow 0.25s, transform 0.25s;
        }
        .related-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(184,137,42,0.12); transform: translateY(-3px); }
        .r-img-wrap { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 1/1; overflow: hidden; background: var(--cream); }
        .r-img-wrap img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 0.4s; }
        .related-card:hover .r-img-wrap img { transform: scale(1.05); }
        .r-wish {
        position: absolute; top: 10px; right: 10px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); border: none; border-radius: 50%;
        width: 32px; height: 32px; display: flex; align-items: center;
        justify-content: center; cursor: pointer; color: var(--text-light); transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .r-wish:hover { color: #e05050; }
        .r-body { padding: 12px 14px 14px; text-align: center; }
        .r-category { font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-light); margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .r-name { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-dark); margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .r-price { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 500; }

        /* ── FOOTER ── */
        footer {
        background: var(--warm-white);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 56px 48px 32px;
        }
        .footer-grid {
        display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1.4fr;
        gap: 40px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto 40px;
        }
        .footer-brand .logo { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 14px; display: inline-flex; }
        .footer-brand p { font-size: 0.84rem; color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 220px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
        .social-links { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
        .social-links a {
        width: 32px; height: 32px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 7px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        color: var(--text-light); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.78rem; transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .social-links a:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold); }
        .footer-col h5 {
        font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-dark); margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .footer-col ul { list-style: none; }
        .footer-col ul li { margin-bottom: 9px; }
        .footer-col ul li a { text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-light); transition: color 0.2s; }
        .footer-col ul li a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
        .nl-input-row { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-top: 8px; }
        .nl-input-row input {
        border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px;
        font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; font-size: 0.84rem;
        background: var(--cream); color: var(--text-dark); outline: none;
        }
        .nl-input-row input:focus { border-color: var(--gold); }
        .nl-input-row input::placeholder { color: var(--text-light); }
        .subscribe-btn {
        background: var(--gold); color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 11px; font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; font-size: 0.84rem;
        font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.06em; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s;
        }
        .subscribe-btn:hover { background: var(--gold-light); }
        .footer-bottom {
        max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
        padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .footer-bottom p, .footer-bottom a { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-light); text-decoration: none; }
        .footer-bottom a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
        .footer-bottom-links { display: flex; gap: 20px; }
    </style>
    </head>
    <body>

    <%- include('partials/user/header') %>
    
    <!-- BREADCRUMB -->
    <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
    <a href="/shop">Shop</a>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
    <span><%= product.name %></span>
    </div>

    <!-- PRODUCT DETAIL -->
    <section class="product-section">
    <div class="product-card-wrap">

        <% 
           const allImages = product.variants.flatMap(v => v.images.map(img => img.url));
           const initialImg = allImages.length > 0 ? allImages[0] : 'https://via.placeholder.com/600';
        %>
        <!-- LEFT: Images -->
        <div class="img-col">
        <div class="main-img-wrap">
            <img id="mainImg" src="<%= initialImg %>" alt="<%= product.name %>"/>
            <button class="wishlist-main" id="wishBtn" title="Wishlist">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/>
            </svg>
            </button>
        </div>
        <div class="thumbnails">
            <% allImages.forEach((imgUrl, idx) => { %>
                <div class="thumb <%= idx === 0 ? 'active' : '' %>" onclick="switchImg(this, '<%= imgUrl %>')">
                    <img src="<%= imgUrl %>" alt=""/>
                </div>
            <% }) %>
        </div>
        </div>

        <!-- RIGHT: Info -->
        <div class="info-col">
        <div class="rating-row">
            <div class="stars">
            <span class="star">★</span><span class="star">★</span><span class="star">★</span>
            <span class="star">★</span><span class="star empty">★</span>
            </div>
            <span class="rating-text">New Arrival</span>
        </div>

        <div class="price">₹<%= (product.discountPrice || product.basePrice).toLocaleString('en-IN') %></div>

        <p class="description">
            <%= product.description %>
        </p>

        <div class="option-label">Available Colors</div>
        <div class="color-options" id="colorOptions">
            <% product.variants.forEach((v, idx) => { %>
                <div class="color-opt <%= idx === 0 ? 'active' : '' %>" onclick="selectVariant('<%= v._id %>', '<%= v.color %>', this)">
                    <div class="color-swatch" style="background: <%= v.color.toLowerCase() === 'gold' ? '#c9a84c' : (v.color.toLowerCase() === 'silver' ? '#a8a8a8' : v.color) %>"></div>
                    <span class="color-name"><%= v.color %></span>
                </div>
            <% }) %>
        </div>

        <div class="qty-label">Quantity</div>
        <div class="qty-row">
            <button class="qty-btn" onclick="changeQty(-1)">−</button>
            <div class="qty-display" id="qtyDisplay">1</div>
            <button class="qty-btn" onclick="changeQty(1)">+</button>
        </div>

        <div class="divider-line"></div>

        <div class="cta-row">
            <button class="btn-cart" id="addCartBtn" onclick="addToCart()">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <circle cx="9" cy="21" r="1"/><circle cx="20" cy="21" r="1"/>
                <path d="M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6"/>
            </svg>
            Add to Cart
            </button>
            <button class="btn-buy">Buy it Now</button>
        </div>

        <div class="perks">
            <div class="perk">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
                <rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13" rx="2"/>
                <path d="M16 8h4l3 5v3h-7V8z"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="perk-text">
                <strong>Free Shipping</strong>
                <span>On orders over ₹150</span>
            </div>
            </div>
            <div class="perk">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
                <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="perk-text">
                <strong>Lifetime Warranty</strong>
                <span>Authenticity guaranteed</span>
            </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        </div>

    </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TABS -->
    <section class="tabs-section">
    <div class="tab-nav">
        <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab(this,'desc')">Description</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab(this,'reviews')">Reviews (24)</button>
    </div>

    <div id="desc" class="tab-panel active">
        <div class="product-details-content">
        <h3>Product Details</h3>
        <p>A modern blend of elegance and minimalism, the Gold Geometric Ring features a sleek, structured design inspired by contemporary geometry. Crafted with a polished gold finish, this ring adds a refined touch to any outfit. Its clean lines and timeless style make it perfect for both everyday wear and special occasions. Lightweight, stylish, and effortlessly chic — it's a must-have piece for those who appreciate modern luxury.</p>
        <p>The Gold Geometric Ring features a sleek and modern design inspired by clean geometric shapes. Crafted with a polished gold finish, it offers a perfect balance of elegance and minimalism. This ring is ideal for everyday wear or for adding a subtle statement to special occasions.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
            <li>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Brilliant-cut diamond
            </li>
            <li>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            18K white gold setting
            </li>
            <li>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Conflict-free certified
            </li>
            <li>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Comes with authentication certificate
            </li>
            <li>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            Complimentary ring sizing
            </li>
        </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="reviews" class="tab-panel">
        <div class="reviews-grid">
        <div class="review-card">
            <div class="reviewer">
            <div class="avatar">P</div>
            <div>
                <div class="reviewer-name">Priya S.</div>
                <div class="reviewer-date">March 2026</div>
